  "hub-to-tips": {
   "title": "From a guest question to a better listing",
   "caption": "It shows how the Knowledge Hub can feed the tips. The Hub reads its facts from the Listing base and collects what guests ask in the Inbox, counted and marked answered or not. The assistant answers only from those facts. A gap becomes a tip, either a shared fact for the Listing base (“Add free parking”) or a better answer in one channel’s listing (Airbnb’s description). Accepted, a fact reaches every channel and the assistant, and a description change reaches that channel.",
